## netlab-corpus v1
## id: c09-kind-gates
## kind: switch
## topo: single-switch
## provenance: authored
## note: lines that PARSE on a switch but whose setter is kind-gated emit
## note: `% Feature not supported`; switchport/vlan lines succeed.

enable
conf t
interface fa0/1
ip address 10.0.0.1 255.255.255.0
ip access-group 10 in
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10
exit
ip proxy-arp
ip directed-broadcast
ip routing
no ip routing
service dhcp
end
